# Skill: wiki-log-entry (PATTERN §6)

> Adapter Cursor della skill `wiki-log-entry` definita in `.claude/skills/wiki-log-entry.md`.
> Costrutto: Cursor rule `.mdc`. File equivalente Claude Code: `.claude/skills/wiki-log-entry.md`.

Template canonici per append a `wiki/log.md`. Ogni agente/skill usa questo template
per la propria entry di log. Formato invariante: `[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] <operation> — <detail>`.

## Template per tipo di operazione

### Ingest (wiki-keeper)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] ingest — <source_slug> → pages: N created, M updated
```

### Develop (dev-agent — da dev-handoff)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] develop — TSK-ZZZ (<layer>) → status: done | files: [<path1>, <path2>] | wave: <WAVE_ID>
```

### Query (wiki-query)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] query — "<query-slug>" → saved: wiki/query/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] query — "<query-slug>" → ephemeral
```

### Promote (promote-status)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] promote — wiki/<path>.md <old_status>→<new_status>
```

### Heal (heal-protocol)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] heal — iter=N fixed=N_fixed residual_errors=K
```

### Lint (wiki-lint)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] lint — report: wiki/lint-report-YYYY-MM-DD.md | errors: N | warnings: M
```

### Kanban Publish (github-publisher)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] kanban-publish — provider: github | pushed: N | skipped: M
```

### Wave Dispatch (orchestrator)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] wave — <WAVE_ID> dispatch: [TSK-A, TSK-B] level=N
```

### Code Review (code-reviewer)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] review — TSK-ZZZ iter=N verdict: pass|conditional|reject
```

### Propagate Resolution (propagate-resolution)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] propagate-resolution — Q_NNN closed → reconciled: US-XXX(ready), TSK-ZZZ(unblocked)
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] propagate-resolution — Q_NNN closed → reconcile-needed: US-XXX → marker
```

### A11y Review (a11y-specialist)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] a11y — <target> → verdict: pass|fail|conditional | critical: N
```

### UX/UI Review (ux-ui-reviewer)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] ux-ui-review — <target> → verdict: pass|fail|conditional
```

### Prototype Generated (prototype-generator)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] prototype — <US-id|TSK-id> → backend: html|react | output: <path>
```

### Tavola Rotonda (tavola-rotonda-moderatore)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] tavola-rotonda — session: <session_id> topic: "<slug>" → <motivo_stop> round: N
```

### Tutor Session (tutor)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] tutor — session_mode: sblocco|apprendimento query: "<slug>" → L1|L2|L3
```

### Semantic Drift Scan (wiki-lint)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] semantic-drift-scan — pages: N | stale: M | embedding_drift: K
```

### Graphify Sync (graphify-sync)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] graphify-sync — target: <slug> nodes: N edges: M → .graphify-state/...
```

### Factory Upgrade (/factory-upgrade)

```
[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] factory-upgrade — from: v2.XX to: v2.YY | applied: N delta | conflicts: M
```

## Regole

- **Formato invariante**: `[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] <operation> — <detail>` (trattino em `—`)
- **Append-only**: mai editare entry esistenti, sempre append in fondo al file
- **Orario**: sempre UTC o ora locale esplicitata; consistente nella sessione
- **Slug**: `<query-slug>` = primae 6 parole della query, kebab-case

## Limitazioni Cursor

- **Append**: usa Edit tool con `old_string` = ultima riga del file + `new_string` = ultima riga + nuova entry.
  Oppure usa terminal: `echo "[YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] ..." >> wiki/log.md`.
